      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/NYLONManila/status/1965057402438610973",
      "text": "What makes you happy? What grounds you to your purpose, especially during the tough days? \n\nFilipino actor and host Shuvee Etrata considers herself an island girl through and through, and returning to her home and her family is enough to keep her fire burning. 🔥\n\nCatch Shuvee at her most honest, hopeful, and humble, only on NYLON Manila VOICES, out now on YouTube. \n\nVideo and fashion direction by @kenndimaano. Videography by @omar.alah. Editing by @truce____evader and @carlosnapshot. Photography by @excelpanlaque. Produced by @_antonmolina. Associate Producer @renzorg. Production Associate @megimogu. Styled by @stevencoralde of @qurator_studio, assisted by @cuyanamarianina. Animation by @truce____evader. Special thanks to @sparklegmaartistcenter, @iamangeljacob. \n\nNYLON Manila VOICES, 2025.\n\n#NYLONManilaVOICES",
