      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/PGMNOfficial/status/1965067619225968721",
      "text": "ICYMI: Habagat season is here again, and once more Metro Manila is drowning in floods. Beloved PGMN Anchor Orion Perez — AKA the Angry Bowtie — breaks down why this problem has been haunting us for centuries: from the warnings of the Spanish era, to the neglected plans of Burnham and Palafox, to the clogged esteros and floodplains we still ignore today.\n\nWhy does Singapore, a country once filled with swamplands, no longer suffer from the same flooding we do? And why has Metro Manila remained hostage to poor systems, disjointed governance, and short-term politics? Orion connects the dots between history, bad policy, and our failure to act on long-term solutions.\n\nhttps://t.co/ciBF0zFx15",
